sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App client
    participant Broker as MQTT broker
    participant Shadow as Shadow service
    participant Device as Device simulator
    Note over App,Device: R = $vc/devices/device-1/shadow/name/tutorial
    App->>Broker: MQTT CONNECT (app token)
    Broker-->>App: CONNACK
    Device->>Broker: MQTT CONNECT (device token)
    Broker-->>Device: CONNACK
    App->>Broker: SUBSCRIBE R/get/accepted, R/get/rejected, R/update/accepted, R/update/rejected, R/update/delta
    Broker-->>App: SUBACK
    Device->>Broker: SUBSCRIBE same exact response and delta topics
    Broker-->>Device: SUBACK
    Device->>Broker: PUBLISH R/get (startup clientToken)
    Broker->>Shadow: R/get
    Shadow-->>Broker: R/get/accepted or R/get/rejected (404)
    Broker-->>Device: Current desired state or missing Shadow
    Note over Device: Apply current desired, or report initial off when missing
    App->>Broker: PUBLISH R/update (desired.power=on, clientToken)
    Broker-->>App: PUBACK (transport only)
    Broker->>Shadow: R/update
    alt Update accepted
        Shadow-->>Broker: R/update/accepted and R/update/delta
        Broker-->>App: R/update/accepted (matching clientToken)
        Broker-->>Device: R/update/delta (power=on)
        Note over Device: Apply simulated hardware change before reporting
        Device->>Broker: PUBLISH R/update (reported.power=on)
        Broker->>Shadow: R/update
        Shadow-->>Broker: R/update/accepted
        Broker-->>Device: R/update/accepted (device clientToken)
        loop Until convergence or deadline
            App->>Broker: PUBLISH R/get (new clientToken)
            Broker->>Shadow: R/get
            Shadow-->>Broker: R/get/accepted (version, desired, reported)
            Broker-->>App: Correlated current state
        end
        Note over App: PASS only after fresh desired=reported=on
    else Update rejected or response timed out
        Shadow-->>Broker: R/update/rejected if rejected
        Broker-->>App: Rejection if delivered
        Note over App: Exit with error, read current state before retry
    end
    Note over App,Device: Arrows illustrate a successful run, not cross-client delivery ordering
